# NOT ignored, deliberately (ADR-0002): `reels/` and `audio/`. This repo is public
# and they stay tracked anyway — a deliberate choice, amended into ADR-0002 (#39).
# A shipped reel and the Suno tracks in `audio/` cannot be regenerated — the site
# drifts, the brand kit is sampled at render, and a Suno track is not
# reproducible from its prompt. This repo is their backup. Do not "tidy" them
# into the list above.

# Agent worktrees (`.claude/worktrees/<name>`) — each is a full checkout of this
# repo, created and removed per task. Never content; never committed.
